[node name="RichTextLabelSlideoutInterrupts" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Panel/Container"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(500, 0)
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 0
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 18
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_italics_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/italics_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/mono_font_size = 0
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[font_size=20][b]Interrupt:[/b][/font_size]

When the interrupt alarm goes off (hourglass is
empty), the person whose turn it is must perform the
interrupt task.

This task is determined by rolling the dice. See the
interrupt tasks below.


[font_size=20][b]Interrupt Tasks:[/b][/font_size]

1. Production incident - move any other player's
pawn back to the starting square in the color
of this pawn.

2. Security incident – Security incident - your pawn must go back
one phase (2 steps).

3. Privacy incident – Privacy incident - you must return an already
finished pawn or (if you do not have an
already finished pawn) you must return to the
start.

4. Retrofit probleem – Retrofit problem - your pawn must return to the
starting square of your color.

5. Your team is super productive! Throw again.

6. Technical windfall - move immediately to the
next phase (2 steps ahead). No need to draw a
card.

"

